span></p><p begin="1:21.900" end="1:25.540" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.900" end="1:22.180">I</span> <span begin="1:22.180" end="1:22.460">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:22.460" end="1:22.907">mind</span> <span begin="1:22.907" end="1:23.170">if</span> <span begin="1:23.170" end="1:23.340">you</span> <span begin="1:23.340" end="1:23.545">wan</span><span begin="1:23.545" end="1:23.750">na</span> <span begin="1:23.750" end="1:24.279">go</span> <span begin="1:24.279" end="1:24.762">any</span><span begin="1:24.762" end="1:25.540">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论你想去向何方，我都毫无怨言</span></p><p begin="1:25.650" end="1:27.860" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.650" end="1:26.040">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:26.040" end="1:26.514">take</span> <span begin="1:26.514" end="1:26.849">you</span> <span begin="1:26.849" end="1:27.860">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会带你抵达那里</span></p><p begin="1:28.898" end="1:30.517" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.898" end="1:29.383">Every</span><span begin="1:29.383" end="1:29.590">day</span> <span begin="1:29.590" end="1:29.805">the</span> <span begin="1:29.805" end="1:30.215">week</span><span begin="1:30.215" end="1:30.517">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">日日皆是周末，只想成为你最好的朋友</span></p><p begin="1:30.720" end="1:32.585" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.720" end="1:31.002">Try</span><span begin="1:31.002" end="1:31.200">na</span> <span begin="1:31.200" end="1:31.440">be</span> <span begin="1:31.440" end="1:31.630">your</span> <span begin="1:31.630" end="1:32.160">best</span> <span begin="1:32.160" end="1:32.585">friend</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">日日皆是周末，只想成为你最好的朋友</span></p><p begin="1:32.585" end="1:34.556" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.585" end="1:32.790">Try</span><span begin="1:32.790" end="1:33.070">ing</span> <span begin="1:33.070" end="1: